window.products.push({"id":262422,"name":"Leg Elevation Pillows Wedge 2 Pcs Single Leg Wedge Pillows for Swelling Foam Wedge for Elevating Leg After Surgery Elevated Pillow for Legs Riser Knee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I+gXM5+xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Leg Elevation Pillows 2 Pcs Single Leg Wedge Pillows for Swelling Foam Wedge for Elevating Leg Rest PillowNote:The Leg Elevation pillows (2 PCS) are Vacuum-packed. Please allow it about 48 hours to expand fully.Product Size: 19.7*7.9*5.9 inch/50*20*15 cm(L*W*H)Color: GrayMaterial: High Density Foam, include Removable & Washable Soft Cover, provide your leg with cozy and protected feeling.Right lying position is super important for those who get ankle injury, Leg broken, ulcer feet.  Function:  Applicable to leg, knee, foot and ankle rest or after surgery recovery, helps leg position after traction of the tibia and femur. Elevate and angle injured legs and knee joints for an optimal healing position. Immobilizing the injured knee joints, and elevating legs above the heart level to reduce blood pooling, reduces swelling and decreases pain. Why this bed assistance devices would be suitable for you? 1. Different with memory foam pillow, high-density foam leg wedge pillow can provide better support. 2. Avoid bedsore for those who lying on the bed for a long time, helpful for position support. 3. Provide 35° to support your legs, elevates 12cm height for lower extremities and maintains the physiological curvature of the lower extremities.5. Suitable for after surgeries like fibula surgery, femur replacement, knee replacement, ACL surgery. The leg elevation pillows take the vital place to make you feel comfortable and relieve your pain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I+gXM5+xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zelen","source_asin":"B09PZSRKS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZSRKS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZSRKS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
