window.products.push({"id":262465,"name":"Stainless Steel Saucepan with Lid, Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Materials 21 CT, Three-Layer Bottom Composed of Pure Aluminum and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ox2WC4anL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The reason why named 21CT is that it is named after a 21% of chromium content. Chromium is the strongest special steel in the metal. In steel structure and tool steel, chromium can improve the strength, hardness and wear resistance, chromium can improve the oxidation resistance and corrosion resistance of steel, it is the important alloy element of stainless steel and heat resistant steel. Adding chromium to saucepan makes product not fear any acidic food challenge and helps the hardness of it stronger, which can prolong the serve life of the pan. The 21 percent high chromium metal is 3.2 percent higher than the SUS304 metal, which is more resistant to corrosion and abrasion. \"C\" and \"T\" represent the initials of Cu and Ti respectively. Firstly \"C\": adding copper, stainless steel can increase the corrosion resistance of stainless steel, at the same time the right amount of copper adding is instead of nickel metal (harm) being added, safe and harmless to the human body and efficient heat conduction, save energy. At the same time, nickel will also cause harm to the environment during the extraction process, and the choice of without nickel is a guarantee to oneself and to the environment. Next \"T\": titanium belongs to the rare metal and has \"probiotic\". It's safe for the human body. The most important thing is that titanium has excellent thermal conductivity, which can quickly and evenly spread heat. Adding titanium to stainless steel can make the heat conduction faster. The combination of the two can greatly improve the performance of stainless steel.  This is why MADY Stainless Steel Saucepan Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Heating Uniform High Efficient Heat Storage Physical Non-Stick Completely Non-Toxic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ox2WC4anL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MADY","source_asin":"B077TH7Y95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077TH7Y95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077TH7Y95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
