window.products.push({"id":262530,"name":"Pillow Perfect Outdoor/Indoor Panama Wave Azure Tufted Seat Cushions (Square Back), 19\" x 18.5\", Blue, 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OL4SY7HsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Panama Wave Azure is a cool-hued chevron pattern that feels clean and modern in your favorite space for lounging, dining, or entertaining. Stacked chevron stripes in cobalt, navy, periwinkle, and white look crisp and fresh on chaise lounges, benches, swings, chairs, and more. Panama Wave Azure was created to be paired with a number of other Pillow Perfect patterns and solids and is available in a variety of pillow/cushion shapes and sizes on Amazon.com.For more than 30 years, Pillow Perfect has been designing and manufacturing decorative pillows and outdoor furniture cushions for the largest online and brick-and-mortar retailers in the United States. We have always been focused on providing the highest level of quality, service, and style, and our talented in-house creative team is constantly watching design and color trends, ensuring that we are always ahead of the curve. Founded by current CEO/Owner Paul and his brother David in 1989, Pillow Perfect products have always been proudly made in the USA, and our Woodstock, GA facility is truly where the magic happens. Each pillow is cut, sewn, labelled, filled, and finished by our team of dedicated employees so you can enjoy it on your sofa, chaise lounge, or in your personal backyard oasis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OL4SY7HsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillow Perfect","source_asin":"B08WKNRVB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WKNRVB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WKNRVB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":262531,"name":"MALOUF ZZKKMPASZP Z Zoned Dough Memory Foam Infused with Real Peppermint-Natural Oil Aromatherapy Pillow Spray Included-King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFi5H0gTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Benefits of Peppermint has a familiar, refreshing scent. Peppermint essential oil is frequently used in aromatherapy for clear breathing and clarity of mind. It is thought to improve respiratory function for deep breathing that can enhance sleep. Peppermint Aromatherapy Spray Included Accompanying this peppermint-infused pillow is a mini spritzer bottle of all-natural peppermint aromatherapy spray. The included 3 mL spray bottle is made with real peppermint essential oil. Use it to refresh the scent of your pillow. Or, spray onto mattresses and bedding to layer the familiar scent of peppermint. King, Queen and Standard pillows include aromatherapy spray. Not included with travel size pillows. ZONED DOUGH Memory Foam Plush memory foam creates a comfortable pillow with excellent support. This mid-loft pillow is made of DOUGH memory foam that molds to the curves of the head, neck and shoulders for personalized comfort without pressure. ZONED TECHNOLOGY design features larger holes in the center and smaller holes around the perimeter to cradle the head while supporting the neck. This unique design also improves airflow for a more breathable memory foam. Rest easy know this memory foam pillow is OEKO-TEX tested for harmful substance. TENCEL Mesh Cover TENCEL botanical fibers create a fabric that is incredibly silky, soft and light. It also has inherent moisture management and temperature control properties that bring cool, dry comfort to the pillow's surface. Gusseted cover can be removed and washed for a constantly clean sleep . To preserve the cover, remove and machine wash in cold to hot water with bedding. Tumble dry on low heat. Cover: 63 percent TENCEL lyocell, 37 percent polyester, Cover sidewall: 100 percent TENCEL lyocell, Fill: 100 percent polyurethane foam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFi5H0gTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B0C5W4L93X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5W4L93X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5W4L93X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
