window.products.push({"id":262554,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Mold, Todram 3D Diamond-Shaped Flexible Silicone Ice Tray with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid and Funnel for Cocktail Whisky Bourbon Pud","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MZdogpUyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Diamond Ice Cubes This ice cube mold is able to make up to four diamond shaped ice cubes at a time. Enhance your visual pleasure while enjoying your favorite drink with these gorgeous and stunning diamond ice cubs. Easy to Clean The ice tray is made with high grade silicone making it dishwasher safe and easy to clean. Make your drink shine Fancy your drink with these diamond ice cubes at parties, meetings, and gatherings! These diamond shaped ice cubes will sure be an additional leisure to leave your guest refreshingly entertained. Main Features: -Set includes single tray and lid, as well as one funnel -Trays made with 100% premium food-grade silicone -Lids are made with food-grade BPA free plastic -To release ice, push upwards holding the bottom of tray. Do not twist or bend the tray to release ice -Freezer safe from -40ºF -Dishwasher safe How to make the shape of the ice cubes perfect? 1. Pour your favorite liquid into the tray with our funnel provided. 2. Press against the edge of the ice tray to relieve excess water. 3. Put in freeze for a few hours or overnight. 4. Ready to enjoy! Tips: 1. To prevent the ice from expanding, please do not over-fill. 2. Before using, please wash and disinfect in hot water. 3. After usage, please clean throughly and store it in a cool and dry place. 4. Do not expose to directly under the sunlight!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MZdogpUyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Todram","source_asin":"B07C26NZ4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C26NZ4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C26NZ4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
