window.products.push({"id":262949,"name":"WalMends Premium Spurtle Set of 10 - Natural Acacia Wooden Utensils for Cooking, Odor Free, Easy to Clean, Wooden Spoons As Seen on TV, Ergonomically ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CbuIcnpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VALUE FOR MONEY - Looking for a versatile and affordable wooden spurtle set? This 10-pcs set includes everything you need to cook up a delicious meal, including a large spurtle, slotted spurtle, medium spurtle, slim/skinny spurtle, mini spurtle, wooden tongs, oil brush, serving spoon, spaghetti server, and salad spoon. NATURAL ACACIA WOOD UTENSILS - Made with natural, odor-free Acacia Wood, these spurtles as seen on tv are both beautiful and functional. The smooth, rounded edges make them safe to use on all types of cookware, including non-stick surfaces. HEAT-RESISTANT - These amazing kitchen wooden spoons are built to last. Each piece is made of premium heat-resistant wood that can withstand high temperatures, giving you a long-lasting experience of safe and healthy cooking. VERSATILE ADDITION - Our spurtle set includes a variety of sizes and shapes to suit any cooking need, and the ergonomic design means you can use them for a variety of tasks without fatigue. Whether you're cooking up a big batch of spaghetti or just want a handy tool for portion control, they are designed to cater all your cooking needs. EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE - Your spurtle wooden cooking utensils can be simply cleaned with soapy water and dried with a towel. To maintain its raw beauty, our oil brush is ideal for getting that perfect sheen on your wooden spoons. The spurtles can be easily hung for storage and dispaly when not in use. ELONGATED DESIGN - Innovatively designed kitchen wooden spoons are perfect for the most complex cooking assignments, making them suitable for the roughest cooks. The extra length creates a protective barrier between the cooking and hands, preventing accidental burns. CARE INSTRUCTIONS - Spurtle wooden cooking utensils are not dishwasher safe and can only be cleaned by hand. Prolonged hot water exposure will damage the protective layer of the utensils. Immediately dry the spurtles with a cloth after hand washing. ONE WOODEN SPURTLE SET FOR ALL JOBS - With four different sizes and functions, the Spurtle set has every utensil you need for your favorite recipes. The original spurtle is perfect for gently folding cake or soufflé batter without deflating it. The medium-slotted spurtle is suitable for sifting flour and dry ingredients. NON-STICK - The protective coating prevents the food from sticking to the spurtle cooking utensils, helping you to scrape the sauce from the sides of the cooking pot. Perfect for stirring and mixing cooking ingredients. HOW TO USE THE SPURTLE SET - Every spurtle has a different strength, making it perfect for a specific task. Use the mini spurtle to mix cakes and the skinny spurtle for holding onions. The larger spurtles are made for mixing and sifting the primary ingredients.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CbuIcnpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WalMends","source_asin":"B0B5YG8Y5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5YG8Y5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5YG8Y5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
